docker-swarm
(allow all traffic and 0/0.0.0.0 in all master and nodes)

in master->docker swarm init --advertise-addr masterip<- put master ip here
 ::then you will get token copy it and paste in nod1 ,2,3
make this changes in all four ->sudo usermod admin -aG docker.

in master.
next check connection with-> docker node ls
it shows all three connections.

docker pull hiremath21/itiss
check images->docker images
docker service create --name xyzweb -p 80:80 hiremath21/itiss
docker service scale xyzweb=3

to check connection and active nodes 
do this in master->docker service ps xyzweb

